ÏControls:
4,6 - run sideways
2 - jump up
1,3 - jump diagonally
8 - enter passages
5 - skip animations

Story:
You found princess Amie's lost tiara, but Storm Master stole it from you! He is going to take it to the princess himself. You'll have to get it back! Watch out for Mork, who is trying to catch you.

Goal:
Collect coins to gain extra lives. Collect rainbows, and they will form platforms for you in the final battle.

Hint: Rumours tell there are two secret rooms in the level! Collect all the coins to make it to the bonus game.

Bonus game instructions:
Place coins into the slots. When the slot is full, coins are spread to adjacent slots. The game is over when all the opponent's coins have been conquered.